-- AGENT-WRITTEN adversarial cases (not hand-derived). Expected results were captured from the original T-SQL.
-- Agreed tests (verification step 2, plain SQL on PostgreSQL) for AdventureWorks2025 dbo.ufnGetStock.
-- GENERATED by npm run agreed-tests -- --object dbo.ufnGetStock. Do not edit by hand: change the fixed cases
-- in the object's spec, recapture, and review tests/AdventureWorks2025/dbo.ufnGetStock.expected.json.
-- Expected results were captured from the original T-SQL on SQL Server and are reviewed at step 5.
